      "text": "It was my honor to join Texas Governor Abbott, along with Virginia Governor Younkin, Tennessee Governor Lee, Nebraska Governor Pillen, and Missouri Governor Kehoe, to serve an early Thanksgiving dinner to TX National Guard troops, Texas State Troopers, and Border Patrol agents stationed on the SW Border. They do amazing work to help President Trump achieve the most secure border in the history of this Nation. A secure border means a drastic reduction in fentanyl that kills Americans, sex trafficking of women and children, known or suspected terrorists entering this country, and deaths for those making that dangerous journey. Under President Trump’s leadership, thousand of lives are being saved. Strong border security results in stronger national security. This success is unprecedented.",
